Add the Object to the Simulation Model
To add the object Station to your simulation model, click 
  Manage Class Library > Basic Objects >
MaterialFlow > Station on the Home ribbon tab.
Compare the sample models: Click the Window ribbon tab, click Start Page > Getting Started > Example
Models > Small Examples. Then, select the respective Category, the Topic, and the Example in the
dialog Examples Collection, and click Open Model.
As the Station is such a central object in Plant Simulation, it figures prominently in a number of topics in
the Step-by-Step Help.
