Tab Importer
On the Tab Importer you can define services for processing the parts, for setting the station up for a
certain type of part, and for repairing the station.
To view Importer Statistics in the Statistics Report, click the object in the Frame, and press F6 (Show
Statistics Report), or click Show Statistics Report on the Home ribbon tab.
You can also click the object in the Frame with the right mouse button and select Show Statistics Report
on the context menu.
