Unavailable Services [Station]
Opens a table, which shows the names of the Failure Service, the Set-up Service, the Processing
Service, and the Transport Service that is unavailable at the moment.
Remarks
The table shows the name of the unavailable service white on a red background in the respective cell.
Double-click the name of the service to open the subtable. Its columns show the Name of the Exporter,
the Amount of services defined, the Amount of services missing, and the Name of the associated
Alternative.
See also
